  "body": "Redelivery of #190 (identical tree at b91fc6ee): that PR's CI events were never dispatched by GitHub across nudge, empty-commit and close/reopen recovery attempts, while every freshly-named branch dispatched instantly. Same audited content:\n\n1. Start-at-login reconciliation at launch (idempotent, best-effort).\n2. Window-close transitions route through handle_window_closed(); tray stop follows.\n3. tray_enabled=false suppresses start-at-login registration.\n4. gui-subsystem startup failures surface via MessageBoxW (win32).\nPlus Linux-with-display clean refusal instead of pystray crash.\n\nVerification: 168 controller/window/mode/assets/rtk/config tests green; +249 lines controller coverage; mutations caught-by-name; ruff/ty clean. Fatal-error tests pinned to win32 runners (Linux lacks MessageBoxW/pystray). MINOR slot **5.54.0** (re-slots at merge).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
